### **8. KEY ARCHITECTURAL PATTERNS**

| Pattern | Implementation | Purpose |
|---------|----------------|---------|
| **Nested Store Document** | KitStore → DesignStore → PieceStore → RxPlaneStore | Recursive domain traversal |
| **RMap-backed Storage** | Every store has `private rMap: RMap` | Yjs CRDT persistence |
| **Snapshot Caching** | `cache` + `cacheHash` + `dirty` flag | Avoid rebuilding on every access |
| **Subscription Delegation** | `fieldSubscribers` Map with lazy creation | Granular observation |
| **Transactional Updates** | `rDoc.transact(() => {...})` | Atomic batch changes |
| **Lazy Loading** | Stores only created on `createXxx()` | Memory efficiency |
| **Bidirectional Sync** | RMap writes ↔ Domain object reads | Always in sync |
| **Cascade Invalidation** | `markDirty()` propagates upward | Parent knows when child changes |

